Project Testing Phase
The testing phase was performed to check whether the FitBuddy application works correctly.
The user input form was tested with valid information.
Different fitness goals such as weight loss, muscle gain and general wellness were tested.
Different fitness levels such as beginner, intermediate and advanced were tested.
Different workout intensities were also tested.
The workout generation feature was tested to check whether Gemini generates a 7-day plan.
The nutrition and recovery tips were tested.
The feedback feature was tested to check whether Gemini can update the original workout plan.
Database operations were tested to ensure that user details and fitness plans are stored correctly.
The admin page was tested to check whether users and their plans can be viewed and deleted correctly.
The application was also checked for errors in user input, database operations and Gemini API communication.
